{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28053","headline":"早行 · 刘郇伯","name":"早行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"钟静人犹寝，天高月自凉。\n一星深戍火，残月半桥霜。\n客老愁尘下，蝉寒怨路傍。\n青山依旧色，宛是马卿乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘郇伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28053.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28053","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}